{"id":"371f1df3500cdcfc","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-set11-intersection-closure-hull.md","title":"ZFC Set11 Intersection Closure Hull","display":"df-zfc-set11-intersection-closure-hull — ZFC Set11 Intersection Closure Hull","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set11-intersection-closure-hull","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set11-intersection-closure-hull"],"display":"df-zfc-set11-intersection-closure-hull — ZFC Set11 Intersection Closure Hull","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set11-intersection-closure-hull"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set11-intersection-closure-hull</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set11-intersection-closure-hull — ZFC Set11 Intersection Closure Hull"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cf21178fae2ba8e\" href=\"?note=9cf21178fae2ba8e\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,H,X,\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(A,H,X,\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>（候选闭集族）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntersectionClosedFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{IntersectionClosedFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（任意非空交封闭族谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11IntersectionClosureHull}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11IntersectionClosureHull}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（本原子定义的闭包壳谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}closed\\text{-}family}\\vdash \\mathrm{IntersectionClosedFamily}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\forall\\mathcal D\\;\\bigl(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal D\\in\\mathcal C\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}closed\\text{-}family}\\vdash \\mathrm{IntersectionClosedFamily}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\forall\\mathcal D\\;\\bigl(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal D\\in\\mathcal C\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}closure\\text{-}hull}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11IntersectionClosureHull}_S(H,A,\\mathcal C,X)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{IntersectionClosedFamily}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\land H=\\bigcap\\{C\\in\\mathcal C:A\\subseteq C\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}closure\\text{-}hull}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11IntersectionClosureHull}_S(H,A,\\mathcal C,X)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{IntersectionClosedFamily}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\land H=\\bigcap\\{C\\in\\mathcal C:A\\subseteq C\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal C\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal C\\)</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{C\\in\\mathcal C:A\\subseteq C\\}\">\\(\\{C\\in\\mathcal C:A\\subseteq C\\}\\)</span> 非空；因此所用交集是集合论中定义良好的非空指标交。</li>\n<li>任意交封闭性推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathcal C\">\\(H\\in\\mathcal C\\)</span>，而交集定义推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 是包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>-成员。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection.md","status":"resolved","id":"9cf21178fae2ba8e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,H,X,\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntersectionClosedFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11IntersectionClosureHull}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}closed\\text{-}family}\\vdash \\mathrm{IntersectionClosedFamily}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\forall\\mathcal D\\;\\bigl(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal D\\in\\mathcal C\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}closure\\text{-}hull}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11IntersectionClosureHull}_S(H,A,\\mathcal C,X)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{IntersectionClosedFamily}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\land H=\\bigcap\\{C\\in\\mathcal C:A\\subseteq C\\}","display":true},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\{C\\in\\mathcal C:A\\subseteq C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"H\\in\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false}],"bytes":1628,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3410","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-set11-intersection-closure-hull.md|58-df-zfc-set11-intersection-closure-hull]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9cf21178fae2ba8e"]}